/Title (We propose ExportGuard is an offline BGP Export Policy Checker designed to identify potential routing risks before BGP routes are advertised to neighbouring networks. It analyses AS_PATH information, export policy rules, and locally available ASPA data to detect suspicious route advertisements. The tool validates inputs, checks policies, and generates clear, explainable reports highlighting affected routes, detected issues, and supporting evidence.  By working offline, ExportGuard helps network operators test and review export policies before deployment without relying on a live router connection.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 774 0 R
/Prev 831 0 R
/Next 870 0 R
>>
endobj
